    A -->|passes| B[Phase 1: Confirm base branch - human gate]
    B -->|no response| X2[Wait - do not proceed]
    B -->|confirmed| C[Phase 2: Collision check]
    C -->|unresolved collision| X3[Abort - ask resolution]
    C -->|clear or resolved| D[Create testbranch]
    D --> E[Phase 3: Capture diff evidence]
    E -->|no changes| X4[Abort - nothing to push]
    E -->|changes found| F[Commit]
    F --> G[Phase 4: Push to origin]
    G -->|rejected| X5[Abort - show error]
    G -->|success| H[Phase 5: generate-pr-body.sh]
    H --> I[gh pr create]
    I --> J[Phase 6: Verify PR state]
    J --> K[Report URL + summary to user]
```

